{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/5bfe89282706e6526502e9d107f70900.poster.avif?t=1772052786\" width=780 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/5bfe89282706e6526502e9d107f70900.webm?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resultare</strong> is a Pachinko Roguelike inspired by Peggle\u2019s physics and Balatro\u2019s quirky combinations. In a game full of decisions, precision, and chaos, can you find the right synergies to crush the quota? Carefully plan each shot as you unlock powerful tokens, build unique combinations, and chase ever-higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One more run won\u2019t be enough.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/98a0ac1f2dc4d5504a2b9329ea036315.poster.avif?t=1772052786\" width=1072 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/98a0ac1f2dc4d5504a2b9329ea036315.webm?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/98a0ac1f2dc4d5504a2b9329ea036315.mp4?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot in <strong>Resultare</strong> is an opportunity. Take aim and watch the effects of your tokens snowball, all while trying to reach the score quota. With over 100 Items, no two runs will be the same. Discover new and powerful synergies that shape how you\u2019ll play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/6f1b54a0d829cf4a5541066126196865.poster.avif?t=1772052786\" width=350 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/6f1b54a0d829cf4a5541066126196865.webm?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/6f1b54a0d829cf4a5541066126196865.mp4?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ Tokens to mix and match for endless strategic builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Tickets offering tactical advantages and gameplay twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+<strong> </strong>Handcrafted stages to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Bosses that will do their best to slow you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different game modes to unlock that change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Difficulties for those who love a challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more to come in future updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/b8dd9e75faf5ec385f54f9e497ad2ef5.poster.avif?t=1772052786\" width=350 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/b8dd9e75faf5ec385f54f9e497ad2ef5.webm?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/b8dd9e75faf5ec385f54f9e497ad2ef5.mp4?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock countless items, difficulties, and game modes when playing. You\u2019ll always have a goal in <strong>Resultare...</strong>\u00a0and if that isn\u2019t enough, you can also pet the cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/a646b97c4c64ff346f79f13225b90433.poster.avif?t=1772052786\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/a646b97c4c64ff346f79f13225b90433.webm?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062650/extras/a646b97c4c64ff346f79f13225b90433.mp4?t=1772052786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/95117a777e0573a8701b5af6a8d9437758b24e4a.jpg"},{"name":"Going The Distance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/b66679044be0a45284d8958fbfeae91f780c0bf4.jpg"},{"name":"Victory Lap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/77ec31b1f4d987c04f1e4a28b4fe3977edd0075c.jpg"},{"name":"LV1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/339778c01bddf9d3a37c19a0f1480b7fd3b6b44a.jpg"},{"name":"LV2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/82125dca901ae678fd6557df384428451005064e.jpg"},{"name":"LV3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3062650/d47a864bdea69